{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2019-10", "window": 2, "start_date": 1570492800, "end_date": 1571183999, "month_true_total": 702, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:10:38 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "55619705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198135384406", "personaname": "Toast", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198135384406/", "num_games_owned": 229, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 573, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 368, "last_played": 1571602019, "avatar": "2b5dd450ae863a9d559084e591ddbef3c8c883ac"}, "language": "english", "review": "Chowdah, pass me the MG-42!", "timestamp_created": 1571167617, "timestamp_updated": 1571167617, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55619384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058589650", "personaname": "K-SIR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/STG-E4/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 180247, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 126814, "last_played": 1744158935, "avatar": "25860267c231f3dddcedb63daf2d0d188632544d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arma3 is awesome, if you like tactical and strategic mil-type simulation. It is highly customizable you can find many add-ons and mods which have been designed to integrate seamlessly into the game. It has many Single Player modes, activities from shoot house to racing Helicopters and Go-karts. Even though I have owned the game for a couple of years I don't think I have played every aspect by a long shot. Conclusion if you like Squad based tactical type Military First person shooters, Arma3 has to be the best with huge expandability, nothing much else comes close to the game play experience that can be found within Arma3. However for best experience it would be advisable to have decent Hardware, Ram and Graphics to compliment the incredible landscapes, terrain and amazing weather visual effects.", "timestamp_created": 1571165840, "timestamp_updated": 1571165840, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55618519", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125485700", "personaname": "Atuvi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/atuvi/", "num_games_owned": 138, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 15274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9371, "last_played": 1745351441, "avatar": "994339d607c71c2c24abd59d162d113073b2e2c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "ArmA III is a very good game that is worth having in the war simulator player library.  The game is beautiful, full of details and wonderfully depicts war.  Many mods and the increasing number of them increase the variety and entertainment of the production.  Shooting in the game is honey, driving around is wonderful, and the options to change equipment give us great satisfaction.  This is one of my favorite games that fills a fairly niche genre of combat simulators.  In addition, the game is live on the web, which also positively affects its life cycle, although it is worth remembering the high level of network players.", "timestamp_created": 1571161319, "timestamp_updated": 1571161319, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": fals